  "id": "special-needs-child",
  "term": "special needs child",
  "definition": "A special needs child is a child with a chronic illness or disability whose care needs are greater than those of children without special needs, such as needing specialised medical care and frequent medical visits. The term refers to the child’s additional support and care requirements, which can place substantial demands on parents.",
